{"ref":"BDB, מַעֲכָתִי","hw":"מַעֲכָתִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲכָתִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.19\">1 Ch 4:19</a>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־הַמַּעֲכָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:34\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.34\">2 S 23:34</a> of one of David’s heroes, We del. <span dir=\"rtl\">בן</span>; read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּיח הַמּ׳</span> Klo HPS; v. also Dr; of associate of Ishmael the Judaean <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.23\">2 K 25:23</a>=<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.8\">Je 40:8</a>; coll.=<em>the Maachathites</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.14\">Dt 3:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:5\" href=\"/Joshua.12.5\">Jos 12:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:11\" href=\"/Joshua.13.11\">13:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:13\" href=\"/Joshua.13.13\">13</a> (all + <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגְּשׁוּרִי</span>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲכָה</span> <strong>3</strong>).—𝔊 Μαχ(ε)ι, Μαχατ(ε)ι, Μααχαθι, etc.","next":"BDB, מָעַל","prev":"BDB, מַעֲכָת"}